[3] NL join: idx-join with outer sscan ic_dim and inner iscan ic_fact (i_ic_fact_dim)     

===================================================
count(ft.pad)    
400     

Query plan:
idx-join (inner join)
    outer: sscan
               class: dm node[?]
               sargs: term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: iscan
               class: ft node[?]
               index: i_ic_fact_dim term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(ft.pad) from ic_dim dm, ic_fact ft where dm.id=ft.dim_id and dm.grp= ?:? 
