count(sb.pad)    
400     

Query plan:
idx-join (inner join)
    outer: idx-join (inner join)
               outer: sscan
                          class: dm node[?]
                          sargs: term[?]
                          cost:  ? card ?
               inner: iscan
                          class: ft node[?]
                          index: i_ic_fact_dim term[?]
                          cost:  ? card ?
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: iscan
               class: sb node[?]
               index: i_ic_sub_fact term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(sb.pad) from ic_dim dm, ic_fact ft, ic_sub sb where dm.id=ft.dim_id and ft.id=sb.fact_id and dm.grp= ?:? 
